  "title": "Jordanna&#39;s Turkey Wild Rice Soup",
  "description": "You can use long grain white rice for all or part of the wild rice, but reduce simmering time to 20 to 30 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Jordanna Novak"
  ],
